  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "Short answer: start with a 7–8B model at Q4_K_M, measure, and only move up if the quality gap is one you can actually na",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The paragraph above is deliberately hard-wrapped at seventy-odd columns, the way almost every model writes prose, and it",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Three quantities, in the order they bind:",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "A rule of thumb that has held up:",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "So an 8B model at four bits is about 4.5 GB of weights, and the cache is what decides whether 32k context fits beside it",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Point Vela at the runtime's OpenAI-compatible endpoint. No key is needed and none is asked for — llama-server does not a",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Then add http://127.0.0.1:8033/v1 as an endpoint and press Check to probe what it can do. The capability row that matter",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Believe the probe. A card describes a model; the probe describes the server in front of it, and that is the thing you ar",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Run the thing you intend to run, on the machine you intend to run it on, before you decide what it is worth. Every numbe",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 3
    }
